{"4429320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CarveOut 2160", "steam_appid": 4429320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429320/extras/7fd31bc88c9b7baa943b9ab418c6d807.poster.avif?t=1786359769\" width=800 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429320/extras/7fd31bc88c9b7baa943b9ab418c6d807.webm?t=1786359769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429320/extras/7fd31bc88c9b7baa943b9ab418c6d807.mp4?t=1786359769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carveout is about <strong>high speeds</strong>, <strong>big air</strong>, and the <strong>craziest stunts</strong> unimaginable in the harshest of environments <br>&gt;&gt; <strong>Outer Space</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are in a not too distant Future in which humanity has already established home bases in space. <br>And what can you do for entertainment in space??<strong> Exactly, watching sports!!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily the quadrillionaire funding the whole space program had a great idea about taking the extreme in extreme sports to a whole nother level: <br>&gt;&gt; A <strong>high speed snowboard competition to the death</strong> in which the winner will obtain all the riches they desire. But this means one thing: This competition is nothing for the faint of heart and it's not just about winning, primarily it is about surviving.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429320/extras/e72dd4fb44a0d16b11a88f638ef02754.poster.avif?t=1786359769\" width=800 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429320/extras/e72dd4fb44a0d16b11a88f638ef02754.webm?t=1786359769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429320/extras/e72dd4fb44a0d16b11a88f638ef02754.mp4?t=1786359769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Core Mechanics</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade snowboard physics inspired by classics like SSX, 1080 &amp; Cool Boarders with <strong>sliding on rails, tricks </strong>and <strong>combo systems</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost</strong> to <strong>takedown opponents</strong> and <strong>break barriers</strong> to get into shortcuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gadgets</strong> like <strong>grappling hooks, rocket thrusters</strong> and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splitscreen</strong> multiplayer for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online multiplayer</strong> for up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various game modes (races, trick events, time attack and more)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429320/extras/b59cda005e6e1be023da2be2aded754a.poster.avif?t=1786359769\" width=800 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429320/extras/b59cda005e6e1be023da2be2aded754a.webm?t=1786359769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429320/extras/b59cda005e6e1be023da2be2aded754a.mp4?t=1786359769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wis